  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The ratio of number of atoms present in a simple cubic, body centered cubic and face centered cubic structure are, respectively :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "QyDpe",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "BJxTj",
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9ff2c",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NSFU3",
      "text": "<math><mn>8</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>SC</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>[Atoms are only at the corners]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>BCC</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>[Atoms are at the corners and at the body center]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>FCC</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>[Atoms are at the corners and at the face centers]</p><p>Here,&nbsp;Z=&nbsp;effective number of atoms in the unit cell.</p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>SC</mi></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>BCC</mi></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi>FCC</mi></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/355fb20b-1fd9-4fda-a088-cbe666e07245-image15.png\" /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/374cb6e0-20e0-4cf2-8131-dab7a3574466-image16.png\" /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/16c8d674-da79-4a5c-b202-6707fa0b21ca-image17.png\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>SC</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>BCC</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>FCC</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
